How it flows:
- EmailPage validates and saves email, then routes to PasswordPage.
- PasswordPage validates password + confirm, creates the Firebase Auth user, then routes to NamePage.
- NamePage collects first/last name, saves to OnboardingState, then routes to ProfileDetailsPage (which you already implemented to upload photo and save profile to Firestore).
- From ProfileDetailsPage, after save, navigate to ProfilePage to display the saved data.

Below are two pages that complete the flow:

- ProfileDetailsPage: lets the user pick a profile photo (camera/gallery), enter weight (kg), height (cm), and body type, uploads the photo to Firebase Storage, saves the fields under users/<uid> in Firestore, then navigates to ProfilePage.
- ProfilePage: streams the users/<uid> document in Firestore and displays photo, name, email, weight, height, and body type.

